  "technical_impact": "An element carries an onmousedown, onpointerdown or ontouchstart handler attribute, so an action may fire on the down event alone; whether it can be aborted, undone or fires on release instead is not visible in the markup, so the page gets one manual-check note; handlers added by script are not inspected.",
