      "expectation": "One needs_review (UNTESTED) note per page, at the root, when an element has\na down-event handler attribute; never pass or violation. A click handler\nalone is not a signal, and handlers attached by script are invisible to a\ndocument check. Pages without such an attribute get no note.",
